    <briefdescription>
<para>Validates cross-shard foreign-key constraints during 2PC prepare. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><heading level="3">Lifecycle</heading>
</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Register FK constraints with <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_foreign_key_validator_1a4bae34d465c37776bfe9e660f1c285c9" kindref="member">registerConstraint()</ref>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Inject lookup callbacks via <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_foreign_key_validator_1a003e37377cd3ba246b59ca4469f2f07c" kindref="member">setKeyExistsCallback()</ref> and <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_foreign_key_validator_1aee31a7ba2234f88a26b4fd1041e91d28" kindref="member">setChildExistsCallback()</ref>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Register all shard IDs via <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_foreign_key_validator_1a6c97e6ce0da0d7a8864e6e5bfff6fe67" kindref="member">setAllShardIds()</ref> (used when no parent-shard hint is given on a constraint).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_transaction_coordinator" kindref="compound">CrossShardTransactionCoordinator</ref> calls <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_foreign_key_validator_1a3f99171d787b0931802b1ad376e86e23" kindref="member">validate()</ref> from inside prepare() before dispatching prepare RPCs to participants.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Thread safety</heading>
</para>
<para>All public methods are thread-safe. The validator is safe to share across concurrent transaction threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
